WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,060
Get on the bus to Yunchuan City

2
00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:07,760
Your crappy car can't hold on anymore

3
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,120
for safety reasons

4
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:10,600
Officials will join us first

5
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:15,810
The three heavily-equipped pickup trucks are big enough for you, Xiao Shen, and you have counted them.

6
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:17,090
There are forty-three of them

7
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:18,770
It just so happened that there were about ten people racing against each other in a pickup truck.

8
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:21,370
Didn’t he say that he would be released when the crisis was over?

9
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:23,850
This is obviously treating us as prisoners.

10
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:28,260
To be able to join such a strong team

11
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:30,940
It's our honor, just be happy

12
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:34,100
If you want, just sit in my car and chat with me.
